MessageEvent (agent)
  assistant: I fixed the bug related to the missing OPENAI_API_KEY environment variable when creating a crew with the Azure provider. The issue was that the `.env` file was only storing AZURE_API_KEY but the OpenAI client expects OPENAI_API_KEY. I added logic in the `create_crew` function to copy AZURE_API_KEY to OPENAI_API_KEY in the environment variables before writing the `.env` file if the provider is Azure.

This should solve the error you encountered when running `crewai create` and selecting Azure....
